Modifications made in this fork:

1. Renamed project from "Mafl" to "HomeNest"
2. Migrated from Nuxt 3 to Nuxt 4 (Nuxt ^4.5.2, Vite ^8.2.2)
3. Migrated @nuxtjs/i18n from v8 to v9 (locale files converted from
   .json to .js to avoid Vite 8 JSON parsing issues)
4. Added storage abstraction layer (StorageDriver interface) with two
   implementations:
   - FilesystemDriver (self-hosted, Nitro useStorage('data'))
   - VercelKVDriver (serverless, @vercel/kv / Upstash Redis)
5. Added dedicated stores: ConfigStore, UserStore, PreferencesStore,
   IconStore — all backed by the StorageDriver abstraction
6. Replaced TCP ping (@network-utils/tcp-ping, node:net) with HTTP
   fetch-based probe for Cloudflare Workers compatibility
7. Replaced scryptSync (node:crypto) with PBKDF2 via Web Crypto API
   for Cloudflare Workers 10ms CPU limit compliance; legacy scrypt
   hashes are auto-migrated on next login
8. Added Nitro routeRules: SWR caching for API endpoints, prerender
   for /login page
9. Added global TTL config cache (5s) in DefaultConfigStore for
   serverless environments where useStorage('main') is not persistent
10. Added session secret process-level caching to reduce KV reads
11. Optimized config version polling interval from 10s to 30s
12. Added pauseWhenInactive for service data polling (background tabs
    no longer generate API calls)
13. WebSocket auto-disabled when using Vercel KV storage driver
14. Added WYSIWYG visual editor (in-page config editing, drag-and-drop,
    property panel, multi-config routing)
15. Added user authentication system (PBKDF2 password hashing, h3
    sessions, admin/user roles, per-user config isolation)
16. Added DiceBear avatar library (27 avatar styles)
17. Added icon picker with Lucide and Homarr icon set support
18. Added favicon auto-detection for service cards
19. Added theme and language switchers in UI
20. Added site import/export functionality

